      "finding": "The published Definition says that 'the right-hand cup-cap is U_r'. Its TikZ paths from (2,0) and (3,0) both end at (2.5,0.9), and two further paths run from that same point to (2,1.8) and (3,1.8). Thus four arcs meet at a single interior point, rather than forming the two disjoint cup/cap arcs of a Temperley–Lieb matching. An additional vertical strand at x=2 also overlaps this supposed generator. The drawing does not depict U_r or the displayed recursive composite; the algebraic formula itself is independent of the drawing.",
